{"seq":2,"slug":"invertible-ops","title":"可逆操作与逆命令：撤销正确性的真正战场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-undo-redo-history/command/invertible-ops","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可逆操作与逆命令-撤销正确性的真正战场\">可逆操作与逆命令：撤销正确性的真正战场</h1><p>整个撤销系统里最容易埋雷、又最难被测试覆盖的地方，是每个操作的&quot;逆&quot;到底对不对。历史栈、快捷键、UI 都是机械的，写错了很快会暴露；而逆操作写错往往悄无声息——撤销一次看着没问题，撤销三次后文档就微妙地不一致了，因为某个逆并没有真正把状态还原到操作前，误差一步步累积。这一节专门解剖&quot;可逆性&quot;：哪些操作天然可逆、哪些要靠保存前态、哪些能自动求逆、哪些根本不可逆只能补偿，以及一条必须守住的正确性铁律——<code>undo</code> 之后再 <code>execute</code>（即 redo）必须回到 <code>execute</code> 之后的那个确切状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可逆性的四个等级\">核心概念：可逆性的四个等级</h2><p>不是所有操作都同样好逆。按&quot;逆的信息从哪来、代价多大&quot;，可以分成四级，这决定了你该用哪种策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>操作特征</th>\n<th>求逆方式</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 自然可逆</td>\n<td>存在数学逆</td>\n<td>记录参数即可</td>\n<td>平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dx,dy)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> → 平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-dx,-dy)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 需前态</td>\n<td>覆盖式写入</td>\n<td>保存 before 值</td>\n<td>设置颜色、替换文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 结构变更</td>\n<td>增删节点</td>\n<td>记录被删内容+位置</td>\n<td>删除段落、插入图形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 不可逆</td>\n<td>副作用逃逸应用</td>\n<td>只能补偿</td>\n<td>发送请求、写剪贴板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一级最省：平移的逆就是反向平移，旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的逆是旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，你只需存操作参数。第二级要存旧值，因为&quot;把颜色设成红&quot;这个操作本身不含&quot;之前是什么色&quot;的信息。第三级最微妙：删除一个节点，逆是&quot;把它插回原位&quot;，所以你必须把被删的<strong>完整内容和它的位置</strong>都记下来，只记&quot;删了&quot;是无法恢复的。第四级是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-undo-redo\">为何撤销重做难</a> 里点过的逃逸副作用，下面单独处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种构造逆的手法\">三种构造逆的手法</h2><p>对应上面的等级，落地时有三种具体手法。</p>\n<p><strong>参数取逆</strong>：适用于自然可逆操作，逆命令只是原命令换个符号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TranslateCommand implements Command {&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private node: { x: number; y: number },&#10;    private dx: number,&#10;    private dy: number,&#10;  ) {}&#10;  execute() {&#10;    this.node.x += this.dx;&#10;    this.node.y += this.dy;&#10;  }&#10;  undo() {&#10;    this.node.x -= this.dx;&#10;    this.node.y -= this.dy;&#10;  } // 反向即逆&#10;  readonly label = &#39;移动&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TranslateCommand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  undo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反向即逆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '移动'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>前态快照</strong>：适用于覆盖式写入，执行时抓拍旧值。这是 <a href=\"command-pattern\">命令模式</a> 里 <code>SetPropCommand</code> 用的办法，通用但要小心：抓拍必须是深拷贝或不可变引用，否则旧值会被后续操作偷偷改掉。</p>\n<p><strong>自动求逆（patch）</strong>：把求逆完全外包。Immer 的 <code>produceWithPatches</code> 在你直接 mutate 时同步产出 <code>inversePatches</code>，据 Immer 官方文档，逆 patch 可用于从新状态回放到旧状态。这是最省心且最不易出错的手法，因为逆不由你手写，而由库根据实际 diff 生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { produceWithPatches, applyPatches } from &#39;immer&#39;;&#10;&#10;function makePatchCommand(base, recipe) {&#10;  const [next, patches, inverse] = produceWithPatches(base, recipe);&#10;  return {&#10;    label: &#39;编辑&#39;,&#10;    redo: (s) =&gt; applyPatches(s, patches), // 正向&#10;    undo: (s) =&gt; applyPatches(s, inverse), // 逆向，库保证正确&#10;    next,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { produceWithPatches, applyPatches } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'immer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makePatchCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">recipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">patches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> produceWithPatches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base, recipe);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'编辑'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    redo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applyPatches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s, patches), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    undo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applyPatches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s, inverse), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 逆向，库保证正确</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    next,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"正确性铁律-undo-redo-与-redo-undo-必须是恒等\">正确性铁律：undo∘redo 与 redo∘undo 必须是恒等</h2><p>逆操作正确性的形式化判据只有一条，但极其严格。设状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，操作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 把它变到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&#x27; = f(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，逆操作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。正确性要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>且</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^{-1}(f(s)) = s \\quad\\text{且}\\quad f(f^{-1}(s&#x27;)) = s&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，撤销后再重做，必须回到重做前的确切状态，一个字节都不能差。违反它的最常见原因有三个：逆操作依赖了执行时未固定的外部值（如 <code>Date.now()</code>、随机数）、前态快照存的是浅引用被后续污染、以及浮点误差累积（连续平移用加减法可能因浮点不精确而漂移，长历史下尤其明显）。对付随机与时间，办法是把执行时用到的&quot;当时的值&quot;写进命令，撤销/重做都复用这个固定值，而非重新求值——这与 <a href=\"../foundations/history-model\">历史数据模型</a> 里&quot;随机数/时间戳需记录当时的值&quot;是同一条原则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[状态 s] --&gt;|execute f| B[状态 s&#39;]&#10;  B --&gt;|undo f⁻¹| C{等于 s?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是 ✓| D[正确]&#10;  C --&gt;|否 ✗| E[逆有 bug&lt;br/&gt;查:外部值/浅引用/浮点]&#10;  B --&gt;|再 redo f| F{等于 s&#39;?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否 ✗| E\">graph TD\n  A[状态 s] --&gt;|execute f| B[状态 s']\n  B --&gt;|undo f⁻¹| C{等于 s?}\n  C --&gt;|是 ✓| D[正确]\n  C --&gt;|否 ✗| E[逆有 bug&lt;br/&gt;查:外部值/浅引用/浮点]\n  B --&gt;|再 redo f| F{等于 s'?}\n  F --&gt;|否 ✗| E</pre><h2 id=\"不可逆操作-从回滚到补偿\">不可逆操作：从回滚到补偿</h2><p>第四级操作——已发出的网络请求、已写入的剪贴板、已发送的通知——无法在物理上撤回。硬要给它们做撤销是设计错误。正确策略是<strong>补偿事务</strong>（compensating transaction）：撤销&quot;发送消息&quot;不是收回消息，而是发一条&quot;撤回&quot;请求；撤销&quot;扣款&quot;是发起一笔&quot;退款&quot;。补偿的语义与回滚不同，它承认副作用已经发生，用一个新的正向操作去抵消影响。</p>\n<p>更常见的做法是干脆把不可逆操作排除在撤销历史之外，只让纯数据变更进历史。比如一个编辑器里，&quot;改文档&quot;可撤销，而&quot;分享到社交平台&quot;这个动作根本不进历史栈，避免用户误以为按 Ctrl+Z 能收回已分享的内容。何时补偿、何时排除，是一个业务决策，在 <a href=\"../practice/undo-redo-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的反模式清单里会给出判断框架。异步操作在协同环境下的可逆性更复杂，涉及远端已经看到并基于你的操作做了后续编辑，那属于 <a href=\"../practice/collaborative-undo\">协同撤销</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可逆性分四级：自然可逆（存参数）、需前态（存旧值）、结构变更（存被删内容+位置）、不可逆（只能补偿）。</li>\n<li>三种构造逆的手法：参数取逆、前态快照（防浅引用污染）、patch 自动求逆（最省心）。</li>\n<li>正确性铁律是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>∘</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^{-1}\\circ f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∘</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\circ f^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都为恒等；常见破坏者是外部值、浅引用、浮点漂移。</li>\n<li>执行时用到的随机数/时间必须固定写入命令，撤销重做复用它而非重新求值。</li>\n<li>不可逆操作用补偿事务抵消，或干脆排除在历史之外，绝不假装能回滚。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"command-pattern\">命令模式</a>：逆操作最终落在命令的 <code>undo()</code> 里。</li>\n<li>后续 <a href=\"../history/selective-undo\">选择性撤销</a>：逆操作还要能&quot;变换&quot;到后续操作之后。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../frontend-offline-first-sync/sync/conflict-resolution\">前端离线优先与同步 · 冲突解决</a>：远端已消费的操作为何逆起来更难。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可逆操作与逆命令：撤销正确性的真正战场","id":"可逆操作与逆命令-撤销正确性的真正战场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可逆性的四个等级","id":"核心概念-可逆性的四个等级"},{"level":2,"text":"三种构造逆的手法","id":"三种构造逆的手法"},{"level":2,"text":"正确性铁律：undo∘redo 与 redo∘undo 必须是恒等","id":"正确性铁律-undo-redo-与-redo-undo-必须是恒等"},{"level":2,"text":"不可逆操作：从回滚到补偿","id":"不可逆操作-从回滚到补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"命令模式：把每一次改变封装成可撤销的对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-undo-redo-history/command/command-pattern"},"next":{"title":"命令合并与节流：让\"一步\"符合人的直觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-undo-redo-history/command/command-coalescing"}}